A couple months ago, I posted a message concerning a boot-up problem
of my Alpha 21164PC/533 + 164SX.  In summary, the machine works ok,
but it has a hard time booting up after I turn off the machine.  The
kbd LED blinks and nothing happens.  Once it boots up, it doesn't have
any problems.  A couple of people reported similar problems.

Anyway, I'm pretty sure this symptom is caused by a faulty CPU fan.
164SX has a safety feature that it shut downs when CPU fan isn't
sending the signal.  So my first question is where can I get the
replacement fan??

