>I�ve got a Board with the "SRM Common Console X4.5-2720" Firmware
installed. How can
>i update the Firmware. There is no fwupdate command... :( I know that i can
run Linux
>using this Firmware it�s just in the case that i need to update the
firmware somewhen
>in the future.

The AXPpci33 is an oldie but goodie.  There were two models, one with an AT
motherboard connector and no PS/2 mouse, the other with a small PS/2
motherboard connector and a port for a PS/2 mouse.  Only the second design
can run Tru64 UNIX.

The directions on www.compaq.com only tell how to upgrade SRM using Tru64
UNIX.  If anybody has upgraded or converted from ARC bios using Linux or
BSD, let us know.  It is not a simple procedure, and a mistake can be
irreversible.

Paul Smith
